WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.168 --> 00:00:01.544
- When someone else is doing my makeup,

00:00:01.544 --> 00:00:02.838
I'm just like, "You do it!

00:00:02.838 --> 00:00:04.464
"You know exactly what you're doing."

00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:06.508
- Yeah, well, you don't wanna
end up looking like a clown.

00:00:06.508 --> 00:00:08.646
(disco music)

00:00:11.556 --> 00:00:13.139
I'm gonna be distracting
them with conversation

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:15.044
to make sure they don't
know they're being pranked.

00:00:15.044 --> 00:00:16.851
(disco music)

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.981
- I'm super excited

00:00:20.981 --> 00:00:23.777
to see what I look like as Kylie Jenner.

00:00:23.777 --> 00:00:25.820
- She has some really good selfies,

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.113
lots of confidence, which I love.

00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:30.649
- This will be my first official makeover.

00:00:30.649 --> 00:00:32.358
- For Michelle, I'm gonna hook her up

00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:34.786
with some raccoon eyes
and some cat whiskers.

00:00:34.786 --> 00:00:37.319
For Jade, we're gonna give her a nice

00:00:37.319 --> 00:00:39.041
extreme orange tan.

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.451
I was thinking of
repositioning her eyebrows.

00:00:41.451 --> 00:00:44.506
For Mallory, she has a very joyful face,

00:00:44.506 --> 00:00:46.454
so I'm gonna make her into a clown.

00:00:46.454 --> 00:00:49.341
(dramatic music)

00:01:06.391 --> 00:01:08.904
- I can tell there's stuff on my face,

00:01:08.904 --> 00:01:11.114
like, I have this extra kind of layer,

00:01:11.114 --> 00:01:13.074
but it's not anything crazy.

00:01:13.074 --> 00:01:15.358
I can understand how people
would get used to it.

00:01:15.358 --> 00:01:17.568
(dramatic music)

00:01:19.914 --> 00:01:21.575
- Oh, no!

00:01:21.575 --> 00:01:23.293
(laughing)

00:01:23.293 --> 00:01:25.254
Oh, shut up!

00:01:25.254 --> 00:01:27.046
- Hold on. (laughing)

00:01:27.046 --> 00:01:27.922
Oh, God.

00:01:27.922 --> 00:01:31.344
Oh, God. (laughing)

00:01:31.344 --> 00:01:33.418
- What?

00:01:33.418 --> 00:01:34.680
Wait...

00:01:36.421 --> 00:01:37.682
Wait, no,

00:01:37.682 --> 00:01:38.891
what is this?

00:01:38.891 --> 00:01:40.009
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:40.009 --> 00:01:42.931
I kind of look like a
pumpkin that's been painted!

00:01:42.931 --> 00:01:44.773
- Wait, this is what she does?

00:01:44.773 --> 00:01:46.733
- Why do I look like a raccoon?

00:01:46.733 --> 00:01:49.569
- I think the only thing
I like is the lipstick,

00:01:49.569 --> 00:01:51.613
so maybe I'll snag that,

00:01:51.613 --> 00:01:54.607
but my face is a totally different color

00:01:54.607 --> 00:01:56.576
than the rest of my body.

00:01:56.576 --> 00:01:58.786
- What?

00:01:58.786 --> 00:02:00.738
I don't get it.

00:02:00.738 --> 00:02:02.374
- Oh!

00:02:02.374 --> 00:02:05.025
- This is a makeover from hell. (laughing)

00:02:07.629 --> 00:02:09.215
- Well, 'cause I didn't
want insult Kylie Jenner.

00:02:09.215 --> 00:02:11.415
I was like, "Oh my God, does
she have to do this every day?"

00:02:11.415 --> 00:02:12.591
- I'm keeping the lashes.

00:02:12.591 --> 00:02:15.219
I am gonna take the rest of
this off and leave the lashes.

00:02:15.219 --> 00:02:17.389
- I'm really glad this isn't real.

00:02:17.389 --> 00:02:19.808
I'm terrified of clowns on a normal basis,

00:02:19.808 --> 00:02:21.801
so, I looked, I was like, "Oh, God!"

00:02:21.801 --> 00:02:23.553
Have you seen the movie It?

00:02:23.553 --> 00:02:25.473
(beep) that movie!

